steam_godforge.upgrade.start.body=Opens the evolution tree; this node does not directly change processing parameters.
steam_godforge.upgrade.igcc.body=Sets the heat speed multiplier to heat^-0.01 and advances the configured speed-penalty table by one stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.stem.body=Multiplies controller Compressed Steam upkeep by 0.8 (rounded, minimum 1 L); with TSE, raises maximum pressure from 70 to 72.
steam_godforge.upgrade.cfce.body=Before TSE, increases the current maximum pressure factor by 20% (rounded down).
steam_godforge.upgrade.giss.body=Auto voltage becomes base + (effective pressure - 1) x voltage per pressure; defaults to 32 + (effective pressure - 1) x 32 EU/t.
steam_godforge.upgrade.fdim.body=Allows Steam Godforge Molten Modules to connect and process recipes.
steam_godforge.upgrade.sa.body=Advances the parallel-cap table by one stage; effective pressure interpolates the cap from the previous stage to the new stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.gpci.body=Allows Steam Godforge Plasma Modules to connect and process tier-0 plasma recipes.
steam_godforge.upgrade.rec.body=Multiplies module steam use by 1-(1-1.05^(-0.05 x maximum charge))/20; the saving approaches 5% as maximum charge grows.
steam_godforge.upgrade.gem.body=Before TSE, changes the maximum pressure factor from 5 to 5 plus the number of active upgrade nodes.
steam_godforge.upgrade.ctcdd.body=Advances the configured parallel-cap table by one stage; the default table doubles the cap at this step.
steam_godforge.upgrade.qgpiu.body=Allows Exotic Modules in Quark-Gluon Plasma mode to connect; Magmatter mode still requires EE.
steam_godforge.upgrade.sefcp.body=Changes the heat logarithm base from 1.5 to 1.12 for smelting modules and 1.18 for other modules, and advances the speed table one stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.tct.body=Advances the parallel table one stage and multiplies pressure interpolation by 3 for smelting/molten modules or 2 for other modules, capped at 100%.
steam_godforge.upgrade.ggebe.body=Sets the overclock time divisor to 2.3 for plasma or 2.15 for smelting/molten; exotic modules require PA
steam_godforge.upgrade.tptp.body=Allows Plasma Modules to run recipes marked as multi-step plasma processing.
steam_godforge.upgrade.dop.body=Advances the configured speed-penalty table by one stage; it has no additional Steam Godforge effect.
steam_godforge.upgrade.cnti.body=Raises the effective heat cap for heat overclocking from 15000 K to 30000 K and advances the speed tableone stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.epec.body=Advances parallel and speed tables one stage; multiplies pressure interpolation by 1+heat/15000 for smelting/molten or 1+heat/25000 for other modules.
steam_godforge.upgrade.imkg.body=Heat-OC energy discount changes from 5% to 8% per step; at half charge, energy saving reaches 15% for plasma or 10% for other standard modules.
steam_godforge.upgrade.ndpe.body=Lets heat above 30000 K affect heat OC with exponent 0.85 for smelting or 0.8 for other modules, and advances the speed table one stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.pos.body=Advances parallel and speed tables one stage; pressure interpolation is multiplied by 1+active nodes/5 for smelting/molten or 1+active nodes/8 for others.
steam_godforge.upgrade.dor.body=Advances the speed table one stage and divides duration multiplier by parallel^0.02 for plasma or parallel^0.012 for other modules.
steam_godforge.upgrade.ngms.body=Advances the parallel table one stage; while voltage is automatic, processing voltage is multiplied by 4 once per constructed ring.
steam_godforge.upgrade.seds.body=Raises Plasma Module recipe access from plasma tier 0 to tier 1.
steam_godforge.upgrade.pa.body=Exotic Modules receive square-root versions of speed and energy discounts; with GGEBE their overclock time divisor becomes 2.0225.
steam_godforge.upgrade.cd.body=Allows the second ring, raises the connected-module limit from 8 to 12, and gives NGMS one additional x4 voltage multiplication.
steam_godforge.upgrade.tse.body=Sets the maximum pressure factor to 70, or 72 with STEM, and advances the parallel table one stage.
steam_godforge.upgrade.tbf.body=Stops automatic voltage updates and unlocks independent voltage input on every module (GUI range: 2,000,000,000 to Long.MAX_VALUE EU/t).
steam_godforge.upgrade.ee.body=Raises Plasma Module recipe access to tier 2 and allows Exotic Modules in Magmatter mode to connect and operate.
steam_godforge.upgrade.end.body=Allows the third ring, raises the module limit from 12 to 16, advances parallel one stage, and gives NGMS another x4 voltage multiplication.
steam_godforge.upgrade.lore=Values shown are the Steam Godforge's current formulas; configurable tables use their default values unless
